## Thread Safety

```typescript
// FFI calls are synchronous and block the main thread
// For long-running operations, use Web Workers:

// worker.ts
import { dlopen } from "bun:ffi";
const lib = dlopen(...);

self.onmessage = (e) => {
  const result = lib.symbols.expensive_operation(e.data);
  self.postMessage(result);
};
```

