# .env.local
DATABASE_URL=./data.sqlite
API_SECRET=your-secret-key
```

```typescript
// Access in server components/actions
const dbUrl = process.env.DATABASE_URL;
const secret = process.env.API_SECRET;

// Expose to client (prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_)
