## Deployment

### Build for Production

```bash
bun run build
bun run start
```

### Docker

```dockerfile
FROM oven/bun:1

WORKDIR /app

COPY package.json bun.lockb ./
RUN bun install --frozen-lockfile

COPY . .
RUN bun run build

EXPOSE 3000

CMD ["bun", "run", "start"]
```

### Vercel

```bash
