| Parameter | Values | Default |
|-----------|--------|---------|
| `format` | `json`, `ndjson`, `csv`, `jsonl` | `json` |
| `uncompressed_webhook` | `true`, `false` | `false` (gzip) |
| `endpoint` | Your webhook URL | None |
| `auth_header` | Authorization header value | None |
