| Error | HTTP Code | Cause | Solution |
|-------|-----------|-------|----------|
| `INVALID_URLS` | 400 | Malformed URLs in getContents | Validate URLs have protocol |
| `CRAWL_NOT_FOUND` | 404 | Content unavailable at URL | Verify URL is accessible |
