  curl -s -o /dev/null -D - -H "X-Figma-Token: ${FIGMA_PAT}" \
    "https://api.figma.com/v1/files/${FIGMA_FILE_KEY}?depth=1" | /usr/bin/grep -iE '^(HTTP|retry-after)'
done | sort | uniq -c
```

```text
  54 HTTP/2 200
